@startuml
title BlackoutRadar — Notification Pipeline

skinparam linetype ortho

start

:Match;

:Application / Processing Flow;

:Create Notification;

:Notification;
note right
Subscription + PowerOutage
must be unique.

Notification has no
technical dependency on Match.
end note

:PENDING;

:Notification Engine;

:PROCESSING;

:Determine delivery channel;

:Prepare message;

:Delivery Adapter;

if (Delivery successful?) then (yes)
    :SENT;
else (no)
    :FAILED;

    if (Retry required?) then (yes)
        :Retry Decision;
        :PROCESSING;
    else (no)
        stop
    endif
endif

stop

@enduml